.TH FYNEDESK-PANEL 1 "March 2026" "FyneDesk" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
fynedesk-panel \- FyneDesk desktop panel
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B fynedesk-panel
.RI [ width
.IR height ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B fynedesk-panel
is the desktop panel for FyneDesk. It runs as an XWayland client inside
the FyneDesk compositor and provides:
.IP \(bu 2
Application dock with configurable icons
.IP \(bu 2
Taskbar showing open windows
.IP \(bu 2
App launcher (search, calculator, URL opener)
.IP \(bu 2
System tray (StatusNotifier D-Bus protocol)
.IP \(bu 2
Status widgets: clock, battery, sound, brightness, network, power profile
.IP \(bu 2
Virtual desktop pager
.IP \(bu 2
Clipboard manager
.IP \(bu 2
Notification center (sidebar)
.IP \(bu 2
Settings dialog
.PP
The panel is normally launched by the compositor automatically. It should
not be started manually.
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I width height
Screen dimensions in pixels (passed by compositor). If omitted, the panel
queries the compositor via IPC.
.SH SETTINGS
Panel behavior is configured via
.BR fynedesk (5)
and the Settings dialog (accessible via the gear icon or Super+comma).
.SS Dock
.IP \(bu 2
.B icons
\- Application names for dock shortcuts
.IP \(bu 2
.B icon_size
\- Icon size in pixels (default: 48)
.IP \(bu 2
.B zoom_scale
\- Dock icon zoom factor on hover (default: 2.0)
.IP \(bu 2
.B bar_position
\- "left" or "bottom"
.SS Clock
.IP \(bu 2
.B format
\- "12h" or "24h"
.IP \(bu 2
.B show_seconds
\- Display seconds in clock
.SH IPC
The panel communicates with the compositor via file-based IPC in
.I ~/.config/fynedesk/
and a UNIX socket at
.IR $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/fynedesk.sock .
.PP
Key IPC files:
.TP
.I windows-state.json
Current window list (compositor \(-> panel)
.TP
.I desktop-state.json
Current desktop index and count
.TP
.I volume-event.json
Volume change notifications
.TP
.I settings-changed.json
Settings reload trigger
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B FYNE_SCALE
UI scale factor (set to 1 by compositor).
.TP
.B DISPLAY
XWayland display (e.g. :1).
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/fynedesk/config.toml
Main configuration file. See
.BR fynedesk (5).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR fynedesk-compositor (1),
.BR fynedesk-ctl (1),
.BR fynedesk (5)
.SH AUTHORS
FyneDesk contributors.
